# Private payloads consumed through requireFile: register them with
# `nix-store --add-fixed sha256 <file>` instead of tracking them here.  Only
# the VPU image (liuqin-firmware-vpu) and the SSC config are still required:
# the other liuqin-firmware-* archives were replaced by the firmware tree in
# the downstream release's boot.img (pkgs/firmware.nix), so local copies of
# them are stale.
# The stock-*.tar.zst archives are NOT listed: data/stock-*.nix imports them
# with builtins.path, so they must stay in the tree for a boot image to build.
data/liuqin-*.tar.zst
